@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. AI picks the category and saves it
POST {{host}}/expenses/smart
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Electricity bill for October",
  "amount": 60
}

### 2. Another one
POST {{host}}/expenses/smart
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Concert tickets",
  "amount": 75
}

### 3. Empty description -> 400
POST {{host}}/expenses/smart
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "",
  "amount": 10
}

### 4. Totals: Bills is not 0 any more
GET {{host}}/expenses/by-category

### 5. Stop Ollama, then send this -> 503
POST {{host}}/expenses/smart
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Train ticket",
  "amount": 12
}
